@UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5258

### OpenAPI specification (Swagger UI reads from this endpoint)
GET {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Running instance info (shows container hostname in Docker)
GET {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/api/info
Accept: application/json

### Health check – endpoint invoked by Dockerfile HEALTHCHECK
GET {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/health

### All todos
GET {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### Incomplete todos only
GET {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/api/todos?isCompleted=false
Accept: application/json

### Create todo
POST {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try docker build",
  "description": "Build an image using multi-stage Dockerfile.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Invalid input – returns 400 with ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Non-existent todo – returns 404 with ProblemDetails
GET {{UAI.ZeroVP.API_HostAddress}}/api/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json